<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), follow the on-screen instructions and select [Active Test] - [Starter Relay].</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Read [ECU Data Monitor] - [Starter Signal] while performing the Active Test.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>When the starter relay is OFF, inspect the starter signal status after the engine starts and while driving.</ptxt>
</atten4>
